     "body": "<p>Part of this has been tested - the proper constrained by link is returned in this scenario: \"In the case that the specified handling cannot be respected, the restrictions causing the request to fail must be described in a resource indicated by a rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\" link in the Link response header.\"</p>",
