     "body": "<p>The proper ConstrainedBy link is returned correctly in the case of 'handling' being invalid.  All is well with this and it meets the spec.</p>\n\n<p>The ConstrainedBy information will also be returned if the ExternalContent Link is malformed in other ways, though that's implementation specific.  Just mentioning that here. </p>",
