  "description": "<p>Once the <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1357\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">external content PR</a> is in, it would be good to check that the proper ConstrainedBy information is sent when the user sends in an invalid request.  </p>\n\n<p>API Information for external content constrainedBy messages is here:  <a href=\"https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#external-content\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://fcrepo.github.io/fcrepo-specification/#external-content</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
